{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:5318-1","published":"2026-11-16T22:34:28Z","modified":"2026-11-17T17:23:14.492707244Z","related":["CVE-2026-74588","CVE-2026-74688","CVE-2026-98260","CVE-2026-99999"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-74588","CVE-2026-74688","CVE-2026-98260","CVE-2026-99999"],"summary":"Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 29 for SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6)","details":"\nThis update for the SUSE Linux Enterprise Kernel 6.4.0-150600.23.125 fixes various security issues:\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-74588: sctp: keep chunk->transport in step with the list it is queued on (bsc#1277768).\n- CVE-2026-74688: sctp: clear control chunk transport if it is being removed (bsc#1277490).\n- CVE-2026-98260: exec: Cleanup POSIX timers right after de_thread() (bsc#1285052).\n- CVE-2026-99999: ipv4: validate checksum_start before completing checksum (bsc#1285687).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP6_Update_29","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Live Patching 15 SP6","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP6_Update_29&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Live%20Patching%2015%20SP6"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7-150600.2.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"kernel-livepatch-6_4_0-150600_23_125-default":"7-150600.2.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:5318-1.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.suse.com/support/update/announcement/2026/suse-su-20265318-1/"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1277490"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1277768"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1285052"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1285687"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-74588"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-74688"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.s